Typical Instruments: Piezo-amplified tenor and baritone ukuleles (often custom-fitted with copper shielding and tungsten wire), Akai S950 and Roland S-760 hardware samplers, Roland TB-303 (for sub-acid squelch), pneumatic trapeze wire transducers, modified industrial air-raid sirens, ring-modulated megaphone vocals.

